# Delivered datasets — kept local, never committed.
# Camera data/: WI-DOT Beltline clips + the per-clip GPS trajectory CSVs that are
# held-out evaluation ground truth (see CLAUDE.md). AV-HV trajectory data/: OpenACC
# (JRC) car-following CSVs. data/camera-data/: frames re-derivable from the clips
# via ffmpeg, so there is nothing to gain by versioning them.
Camera data/
AV-HV trajectory data/
data/camera-data/

